  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Weight of pole <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p>At equator due to rotation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>R</mi><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>so&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>W</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>g</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>m</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>R</mi><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8756;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>P</mi></msub><mo>&#62;</mo><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>e</mi></msub></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">p</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p><p>So,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mi>e</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>48</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>83</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mo>.</mo></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>W</mi><mi mathvariant=\"italic\">e</mi></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>49</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi></math></p>",
